$('savePreset').onclick=()=>{$('presetName').value='';$('saveDialog').showModal();$('presetName').focus();};$('cancelSave').onclick=()=>$('saveDialog').close();$('saveForm').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const name=$('presetName').value.trim();if(!name)return;const next=[...saved,{name,sound:snapshot()}].slice(-50);try{localStorage.setItem('klang-sounds',JSON.stringify(next));saved=next;renderSaved();$('saveDialog').close();notice('saved');}catch{notice('saveError',{},true);}};$('savedPresets').onchange=e=>{if(e.target.value==='')return;try{if(source!=='synth')chooseSource('synth');setSound(saved[Number(e.target.value)].sound);}catch{notice('invalidShare',{},true);}};
$('shareBtn').onclick=()=>{const payload={v:1,sound:snapshot(),experiment,lang};const bytes=new TextEncoder().encode(JSON.stringify(payload));let raw='';bytes.forEach(b=>raw+=String.fromCharCode(b));const encoded=btoa(raw).replaceAll('+','-').replaceAll('/','_').replaceAll('=','');$('shareLink').value=location.origin+location.pathname+'#sound='+encoded;$('shareDialog').showModal();};$('copyLink').onclick=async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText($('shareLink').value);notice('copied');$('shareDialog').close();}catch{$('shareLink').select();notice('copyError');}};
$('exportWav').onclick=()=>{const sampleRate=48000,data=generateSamples(sound,sampleRate*3,sampleRate),level=Number($('volume').value);for(let i=0;i<data.length;i++)data[i]*=level*Math.min(1,i/480,(data.length-1-i)/480);const blob=new Blob([wavBuffer(data,sampleRate)],{type:'audio/wav'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='klanglabor-'+sound.fundamental+'Hz.wav';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);notice('exported');};
